# throw_dummy's throw as a lob under the dummy's fall speed (5 m/s): the rock reaches the dummy and
# nudges it, its owner claims nothing by the same rule the host applies, and the dummy stands, so
# the check that it fell must fail.
scenario mf_dummy_stands
scene dummy_wall
seed 23
guests 1
settle 6s
net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms loss 2%
p1 walk rock_b
p1 grab rock_b as lift
p1 wait 300ms
p1 throw dummy speed 3.5 as dummy
expect result lift granted
expect moved dummy >= 1cm
expect effect dummy
expect effects_once
